// 析构的三项性质（评审 R3）：可否提前、可否遗忘、可否隐式析构；类型参数默认要求后两项
class Guard(n: Int) deinit
class Scope(n: Int) deinit unforgettable
class Ticket(n: Int) consume
class Broken(n: Int) unforgettable  // ERR
class HoldsScope(s: Scope, n: Int)
class HoldsTicket(t: Ticket)
class Linear(n: Int) deinit unforgettable consume
class Leaky(s: Rc<Scope>)  // ERR
class Shared(g: Rc<Guard>)
class Generic<T>(item: Rc<T>)
class Loose<T: ?Forgettable>(item: Rc<T>)  // ERR
class Owner<T: ?Forgettable + ?ImplicitDrop>(item: Box<T>)
expect EarlyDrop Guard = no
expect Forgettable Guard = yes
expect ImplicitDrop Guard = yes
expect EarlyDrop Scope = no
expect Forgettable Scope = no
expect ImplicitDrop Scope = yes
expect Forgettable Ticket = yes
expect ImplicitDrop Ticket = no
expect EarlyDrop Ticket = no
expect EarlyDrop HoldsTicket = no
expect Forgettable HoldsScope = no
expect why Forgettable HoldsScope = HoldsScope.s -> Scope（声明使它不满足 Forgettable）
expect ImplicitDrop HoldsTicket = no
expect Forgettable Linear = no
expect ImplicitDrop Linear = no
expect wf Rc<Scope> = no
expect wf Rc<Guard> = yes
expect wf Box<Scope> = yes
expect wf List<Rc<Scope>> = no
expect wf Generic<Scope> = no
expect wf Generic<Guard> = yes
expect wf Generic<Ticket> = no
expect wf Owner<Scope> = yes
expect wf Owner<Ticket> = yes
expect Forgettable Owner = if T: Forgettable
expect Forgettable Owner<Scope> = no
expect wf List<Scope> = yes
expect wf Rc<Ticket> = no
expect wf Box<Ticket> = yes
expect EarlyDrop Any = no
expect Transferable Any = no
expect Forgettable Any = yes
expect wf Rc<Any> = yes
